 The Core Idea**\n\nEvery piece of junk in orbit matters. You\u2019ll pilot your ship, chase down derelict satellites, and choose:\n\n- Just scrap it for quick profit\n- Salvage valuable parts for rare components!\n\nAll your efforts will feed into a global salvage counter, showing the progress of the entire player community. \n\n\ud83c\udf0c This is just the beginning. Jump in now, help shape the future, and let\u2019s Save Our Orbit\u2014together.", "display_long_description_unprocessed": "**\ud83c\udf0d SAVE OUR ORBIT \u2013 Together, let\u2019s clean the skies.**\n\nThe future of Earth\u2019s orbit is in our hands. For decades, satellites and rockets have left debris circling above our planet. Now it\u2019s up to us\u2014the scrappers, salvagers, and pioneers\u2014to clean up the mess, piece by piece. \n\n**\ud83d\ude80 Built Together with the Community**\n\nSave Our Orbit is being developed in stages, and we need you on board from the very beginning. Each update will expand the game with new features, systems, and mechanics, but the direction will be shaped by your feedback. You\u2019re not just playing\u2014you\u2019re helping us decide the future of this project.\n\n**\u267b\ufe0f The Core Idea**\n\nEvery piece of junk in orbit matters. You\u2019ll pilot your ship, chase down derelict satellites, and choose:\n\n- Just scrap it for quick profit\n- Salvage valuable parts for rare components!\n\nAll your efforts will feed into a global salvage counter, showing the progress of the entire player community. \n\n\ud83c\udf0c This is just the beginning. Jump in now, help shape the future, and let\u2019s Save Our Orbit\u2014together.", "genre_names": ["Sandbox", "Simulation"], "has_in_app_ads": false, "id": "24391056090563861", "is_approved": false, "is_concept": false, "is_enterprise_enabled": false, "organization": {"id": "", "is_authorized_for_quest": false, "application_groupings": {"count": 0, "nodes": [], "__typename": "", "typename_enum": 0}}, "platform": "", "